# Google Maps Platform API Key for the Multi-Day Trip Itinerary Planner
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and replace the placeholder with your key.
#
# Quickstart (Free Zero-Billing Prototyping):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing card required)
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms and generate/reveal your key
#   4. Paste the key below into `.env.local`
#
# Production Setup:
#   - Create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console:
#     https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Time Zone API
#   - Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and designated APIs:
#     https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
